@media_appearance
title: Media appearance
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_national
view-if: appearance_timer <= 0 and sanchez_leader = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; appearance_timer = 1

= Media appearance

Your press office has offers from every kind of outlet. Each reaches a different audience. Where do you go?

- @tv: A prime-time TV interview (everyone, a little)
- @radio: Morning radio (pensioners and the middle class)
- @streamers: YouTube and streamers (young people)
- @morning_tv: Morning TV and women's magazines (women)
- @regional_press: The regional press (rural Spain)
- @easy_discard

@tv
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 1, pensioners: 1, professionals: 0.8, students: 0.8, unemployed: 0.8, homemakers: 0.8, self_employed: 0.5}); window.SpainGame.recalculate(Q); } !}

Millions watch. Nobody remembers much the next day, but it helps.

@radio
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'pensioners', 1.5); window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'middle', 1.5); window.SpainGame.recalculate(Q); } !}

An hour of serious questions on Cadena SER and COPE. Older and middle-class listeners take you seriously.

@streamers
on-arrival: {! Q.modernisers_dissent -= 2; Q.institutionalists_dissent += 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'young', 2.5); window.SpainGame.recalculate(Q); } !}

The clips go viral, some for the right reasons. [? if last_target_factor < 100 : This audience has heard it before: the effect is [+ last_target_factor +]% of a fresh campaign. ?]

@morning_tv
on-arrival: {! Q.progressives_dissent -= 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'women', 2.5); window.SpainGame.recalculate(Q); } !}

Childcare, equal pay, gender violence: an audience the big debates often ignore. [? if last_target_factor < 100 : This audience has heard it before: the effect is [+ last_target_factor +]% of a fresh campaign. ?]

@regional_press
on-arrival: {! Q.regional_leaders_dissent -= 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'rural', 2.5); window.SpainGame.recalculate(Q); } !}

Interviews with the local papers of Soria, Teruel and Zamora: depopulation, trains, rural doctors. [? if last_target_factor < 100 : This audience has heard it before: the effect is [+ last_target_factor +]% of a fresh campaign. ?]

